        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8469EXT, Single Cylinder Square Deadbolt Exterior Replacement Trim</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is exterior replacement trim for the Emtek Square Single Cylinder Deadbolt and includes the square rose and lock cylinder.  It does not include the interior thumbturn, latch, or strike.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Square Single Cylinder Deadbolt Exterior Replacement Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass collar and rosette.</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Contemporary Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 5/8\"</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern7-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354499\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
